WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.460
[CLANK]

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.811
FALCON: It feels like it
belongs to someone else.

00:00:05.811 --> 00:00:08.793
[CLANKING]

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:14.762
 That shield represents a lot
of things to a lot of people.

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:18.213
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.280
 Symbols are nothing
without the women

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.510
and men that give them meaning.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.700
 We need someone
to inspire us again.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.520
 The world's more
complicated now.

00:00:44.987 --> 00:00:46.120
WOMAN: You're never
going to stop.

00:00:49.431 --> 00:00:51.323
[EXPLOSION]

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.270
This world is ours.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:57.130
There's no going back.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:03.090
FALCON: Doesn't
have to be a war.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.050
 It already is.

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:12.320
FALCON: We can't
lose this fight.

00:01:15.635 --> 00:01:16.520
If we do this--

00:01:19.387 --> 00:01:20.920
WINTER SOLDIER: We're
going do it our own way.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.110
 So, we're partners.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:35.950
 Co-workers.

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.100
 Not necessarily a team.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.370
 No.

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:41.800
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.680
[EXPLOSION]

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.420
 We look damn good, though.

